# Mapping, schema v2.
#
# Anchored on PARTS, not on requirements -- matching SRS FREQ-3 ("the
# identifier of the system model element and the name of its attribute, the
# CAD object and its parameter") and the architecture slide's table
# partdef -> component, attribute -> parameter.
